10	 * already belongs to another owner, before {@link SaveOwner} runs. Handled with 409 by
11	 * {@code DuplicateHouseholdHandler}. Skipped when the request opts in with
12	 * {@code sharesHousehold=true}, so a declared household member is created instead.
